	And the contact with the email address "usr.koroneiki4@lrcustomer.com.broken" assigned the account "Korusr - ${staticProjectName}" should have the contact role "Secondary Contact"
	And the contact with the email address "usr.koroneiki2@lrcustomer.com.broken" assigned the account "Korusr - ${staticProjectName}" should not have the contact role "Primary Contact"
	And the contact with the email address "usr.koroneiki2@lrcustomer.com.broken" assigned the account "Korusr - ${staticProjectName}" should not have the contact role "Secondary Contact"

